sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant API as Backend AI Gateway
    participant Q as AI Job Queue
    participant P as Provider Router
    participant C as Prompt Cache
    participant L as Usage Ledger

    User->>FE: Request AI action
    FE->>API: POST /api/ai/jobs
    API->>API: permission + budget + sensitive check
    API->>Q: insert queued job
    API-->>FE: 202 job_id + poll_url
    FE->>API: GET /api/ai/jobs/{id}
    API-->>FE: queued/running
    Q->>P: worker starts job
    P->>C: check cache
    alt cache hit
        C-->>P: cached JSON
    else cache miss
        P->>P: call primary/fallback provider
    end
    P->>API: validate JSON schema
    API->>L: write usage/cost/cache status
    API->>Q: update succeeded/failed
    FE->>API: GET /api/ai/jobs/{id}/result
    API-->>FE: result + draft ids
    alt user cancels queued/running
        FE->>API: POST /api/ai/jobs/{id}/cancel
        API->>Q: status=canceled
    else retry failed
        FE->>API: POST /api/ai/jobs/{id}/retry
        API->>Q: status=queued retry_count+1
    end
